// hipaa — US Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act
//
// The law: HIPAA does not restrict where protected health information is
// stored. A cloud provider holding it is a business associate: it must sign
// a business associate agreement and implement the Security Rule's
// safeguards (45 CFR Part 164, Subpart C).
//
// This pack: offers must have a contract and an audit (T2 or better). Mark
// the health data itself `sensitivity = S3`, which raises its services to
// T3.
//
// Not covered: the business associate agreement itself. Bailiwick cannot
// see contracts; make sure one is signed with every vendor you deploy to.
//
// Use `import "hipaa"`. Not legal advice.

policy hipaa {
  min_trust = T2
}
